=== Generated Answer (model draft; check against evidence) ===
On the offensive language identification task, the best-performing model was LSTM and GRU with Attention, which achieved an F1-macro of 0.89 [6]. Among classical machine learning approaches, the linear SVM achieved the best results at 0.80 [6]. Additionally, monolingual Greek word embeddings performed significantly better than multilingual BERT embeddings [1].
